               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>hypromellose, lactose monohydrate, magnesium stearate, polyethylene glycol, polysorbate, povidone, pregelatinized starch, and titanium dioxide</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260101"/>
            </section>
